            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CR Lee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great recipe! I can see where some people might find it too spicy if they can't take much spice, but I thought it was perfect as is. I used it on spiral ham for breakfast, frying it on the stove top with some olive oil, and even though I don't do ham often, I will start having it more now!",
